      "id": "fb55a6ec-7b2e-4b41-9704-3065cdfc2f1f",
      "name": "03 - Initial Emergency Detection"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=\nYou are a medical assistance assessment system.\n\nAnalyze the patient record below.\n\nPATIENT RECORD:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json, null, 2) }}\n\nTASK:\n1. Summarize the reported symptoms.\n2. Identify possible health concerns without diagnosing.\n3. Classify urgency as Emergency, Urgent, or Standard.\n4. Explain the reason for the urgency classification.\n5. Recommend safe next steps.\n6. Require doctor review for every case.\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n- If has_emergency_red_flag is true, emergency_detected must be true.\n- Never downgrade an existing emergency flag.\n- Emergency cases must receive immediate emergency care instructions.\n- In India, recommend calling 112 for emergencies.\n- Never prescribe medication or dosage.\n- Never claim the patient is medically safe.\n- Never invent patient details.\n- assessment_status must be Pending Medical Review.\n- Return output matching the connected JSON schema.\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        608,
        -96
      ],
      "id": "40c3eac7-d54e-448d-8c21-b77364f0de7a",
      "name": "04 - AI Medical Assessment Chain"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nreturn $input.all().map(item => {\n  const raw = item.json.output || item.json;\n\n  // Handle structured output\n  const assessment = raw.properties || raw;\n\n  const urgency = String(\n    assessment.urgency_level?.type ||\n    assessment.urgency_level ||\n    \"Urgent\"\n  );\n\n  const emergencyDetected =\n    assessment.emergency_detected?.type === true ||\n    assessment.emergency_detected === true ||\n    urgency.toLowerCase() === \"emergency\";\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      patient_name:\n        assessment.patient_name?.type ||\n        assessment.patient_name || \"\",\n\n      case_id:\n        assessment.case_id?.type ||\n        assessment.case_id || \"\",\n\n      symptom_summary:\n        assessment.symptom_summary?.type ||\n        assessment.symptom_summary || \"\",\n\n      urgency_level: emergencyDetected\n        ? \"Emergency\"\n        : [\"Urgent\", \"Standard\"].includes(urgency)\n          ? urgency\n          : \"Urgent\",\n\n      emergency_detected: emergencyDetected,\n\n      emergency_reason:\n        assessment.emergency_reason?.type ||\n        assessment.emergency_reason || \"\",\n\n      recommended_action:\n        assessment.recommended_action?.type ||\n        assessment.recommended_action || \"\",\n\n      doctor_review_required: true,\n\n      assessment_status: \"Pending Medical Review\"\n    }\n  };\n});\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
